        {
          "items": [
            "Turquoise Tides, a pet-friendly 4-bedroom, 4.5-bath luxury home in the gated Treetop Village of Seacrest Beach. Experience walking to 30A amenities, without the traffic of 30A via a 2nd private gated access on highway 98. Designed for up to 14 guests, this elegant retreat features airy coastal interiors, a chef’s kitchen, and spa-inspired king-size suites, including a main-level primary suite, plus oversized bunk room with 6 twin beds. Enjoy deeded beach access and complimentary tram service, as well as a quiet and convenient community pool. This serene, upscale setting is just minutes from all of the dining, shopping, and amenities of Alys and Rosemary Beach. And when it's time to retreat from all of the 30a activity, a spacious outdoor living area offers privacy with pine-filled wetlands instead of neighbors for quiet afternoon naps or evening cocktails with friends.",
